    {
      "block_id": 9,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "The decibels are shown as negative values from a maximum of 0 because this is the way a record­\ning device, such as a tape recorder, shows the recording level. Usually, the recorder has a dial \nshowing 0 as the optimum recording level. Anything less than the optimum value is shown as a \nminus quantity.\n",
      "bbox": [
